  "description": "You came to hunt dinosaurs.\n\nYou did not expect them to be your type.\n\nBattle ancient creatures in turn-based combat, capture them, and watch them transform into anime boys with a raw, primal energy that hits different. \n\nEach one carries the spirit of his dinosaur form into every conversation, every date, every moment you share.\nMeet your prehistoric matches:\n\n● A T-Rex boy who acts tough but melts when you actually listen to him\n● A Velociraptor boy who's always three steps ahead and makes you work for every smile\n● A Triceratops boy built like a tank, with a heart even bigger than his horns\n\nYour choices shape the bond. Your battles unlock the story.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n♥ CATCH & TRANSFORM: Defeat dinosaurs in battle and discover their stunning anime forms. Ancient power, modern charm.\n\n♥ TURN-BASED COMBAT: Fight smart, date better. Every victory opens a new connection.\n\n♥ DATES & VISUAL NOVEL CHOICES: Build real bonds through choices, conversations, and exclusive unlockable scenes.\n\n♥ PRIMAL PERSONALITIES: Each boy's dino instincts shape who he is. Wild, loyal, unpredictable, and completely yours to figure out.\n\n♥ MULTIPLE ENDINGS: How it ends depends on how you fight, how you listen, and how deep you go.\n\n\nSixty-five million years in the making.\nHe was worth the wait.\n\nReady to find your primeval match?",
